ty to  kind of prolong this guy wondering where  the heck i went  um and so then we take this guy out now  here i'm just looking for  any upgrades any ammo as you see here my  teammate called out like a riot one and  we were talking about that earlier how  incredibly important it is to use your  weapons together so i get that fused up  right there  um and i already hear more shots more  call-outs that they're  enemy teams fighting so here this is  what i love about the ripper now  personally i love being a support player  so any target that i see  i'm going to be putting shots down range  as you can see here i'm focusing down  low and then immediately acknowledge  another player up top  um and then just kind of transition from  there and then there's just so much  loot scattered on the ground as you see  here i kind of take a slow time of  making sure that i'm not leaving any  fuse ups behind  and we go on to uh finish the fight  finish the game  that's all for today you guys thank you  so much graeme and tanner for joining us  sharing your insight and having a great  time  for everyone watching from home make  sure you're here next week because we  are diving even deeper  into hyperscape and we are going to be  showing off some more of your community  highlights so make sure you're  submitting those using  hyperscape but before you go don't  forget we have  another memory shard hint for you check  it out  you
 

